       "Target operating system is not specified. "
       "cpuinfo will compile, but cpuinfo_initialize() will always fail.")
   SET(CPUINFO_SUPPORTED_PLATFORM FALSE)
-ELSEIF(NOT CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME MATCHES "^(Windows|WindowsStore|CYGWIN|MSYS|Darwin|Linux|Android|FreeBSD|Emscripten)$")
+ELSEIF(NOT CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME MATCHES "^(Windows|WindowsStore|CYGWIN|MSYS|Darwin|Linux|Android|FreeBSD|Emscripten|OHOS|HarmonyOS)$")
   IF(${CMAKE_VERSION} VERSION_GREATER_EQUAL "3.14" AND NOT IS_APPLE_OS)
     MESSAGE(WARNING
       "Target operating system \"${CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME}\" is not supported in cpuinfo. "
@@ -173,7 +189,7 @@ IF(CPUINFO_SUPPORTED_PLATFORM)
       src/x86/cache/init.c
